      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_01.mp3",
      "text": "I respect you Ivy.",
      "duration": 1.83
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Ivy",
      "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_02.mp3",
      "text": "I'm waiting for the other shoe to drop.",
      "duration": 2.492
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Seven",
      "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_03.mp3",
      "text": "I mean it.  You saw the world as it was and decided it was not acceptable to you.  That's to be commended.",
      "duration": 7.558
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Ivy",
      "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_04.mp3",
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "duration": 0.728
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "character": "Seven",
      "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_05",
      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_05.mp3",
      "text": "That being said, if you have an ill timed bout of heroism and try to stop me from reaching my destiny I will make you suffer.",
      "duration": 8.137
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "character": "Ivy",
      "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_06",
      "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_gigawatt_tengu_convo02_06.mp3",
      "text": "There it is.",
      "duration": 1.0
    }
  ]
}